--Description: (#10 corrected)  “Final” report that lists EVERY co‑purchased
-- item (not just the top one) together with its total quantity per month for
-- the Nov‑2020 to Jan‑2021 window.  Results are ordered by month then quantity
-- (desc).  LIMIT 20 is kept for quick inspection.
WITH all_events AS (
